  "description": "Our Mid-Section Tells Us All We Need To Know LOL 🏋️vs.",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only episode🔒 </strong></em>of Mid-Week Movers. Here we review 10 stocks from member requests, and rate them from worst to first. The last 2 episodes have produced winners thus far. HDB continues to look strong as it works through a consolidation phase. </p><ul><li><p>14 May 2025 Winners: 🥈ONON +5.3%, 🥇<strong>AS +25.1%</strong> </p></li><li><p>21 May 2025 Winners: 🥈 BTI +2%, 🥇 HDB +2.1%</p></li></ul><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p>",
